000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PLCYBAT.
000300* ASHGROVE MUTUAL  POLICY RENEWAL BATCH            1987
000400* READS POLMAST THROUGH PLCYIO.  TOTALS PREMIUM, RENEWALS DUE.
000500 DATA DIVISION.
000600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000700 01  WS-CTL.
000800     05  WS-FUNC      PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
000900     05  WS-STAT      PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
001000     05  WS-COUNT     PIC 9(5)  VALUE 0.
001100     05  WS-RENEW     PIC 9(5)  VALUE 0.
001200     05  WS-PREMIUM   PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
001300     05  WS-EDIT      PIC Z(8)9.99.
001400 01  WS-IO.
001500     05  POL-REC.
001600         10  POL-NUMBER   PIC X(10).
001700         10  POL-HOLDER   PIC X(20).
001800         10  POL-STATE    PIC XX.
001900         10  POL-PREMIUM  PIC 9(7)V99.
002000         10  POL-RENEW    PIC 9(8).
002100         10  FILLER       PIC X(31).
002200     05  WS-GUARD     PIC X(8)  VALUE 'ASHGROVE'.
002300     05  WS-SPARE     PIC X(800) VALUE SPACES.
002400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002500 MAIN-PARA.
002600     MOVE 'O' TO WS-FUNC.
002700     CALL 'PLCYIO' USING WS-FUNC POL-REC WS-STAT.
002800     MOVE 'R' TO WS-FUNC.
002900     CALL 'PLCYIO' USING WS-FUNC POL-REC WS-STAT.
003000     PERFORM PROCESS-PARA UNTIL WS-STAT NOT = '00'.
003100     MOVE 'C' TO WS-FUNC.
003200     CALL 'PLCYIO' USING WS-FUNC POL-REC WS-STAT.
003300     MOVE WS-PREMIUM TO WS-EDIT.
003400     DISPLAY 'RESULT POLICIES=' WS-COUNT ' RENEWALS=' WS-RENEW
003500         ' PREMIUM=' WS-EDIT.
003600     STOP RUN.
003700 PROCESS-PARA.
003800     IF WS-GUARD NOT = 'ASHGROVE'
003900         DISPLAY 'RESULT GUARD OVERWRITTEN AFTER RECORD ' WS-COUNT
004000             ' GUARD=[' WS-GUARD ']'
004100         MOVE 'ASHGROVE' TO WS-GUARD.
004200     ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT.
004300     ADD POL-PREMIUM TO WS-PREMIUM.
004400     IF POL-RENEW NOT > 20261231
004500         ADD 1 TO WS-RENEW.
004600     CALL 'PLCYIO' USING WS-FUNC POL-REC WS-STAT.
